{"title":"1995 USAMO Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/8/30833a60904f17b586c01c8b9b72ea97812083ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q_1,q_2,...$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"61\" height=\"11\" /> is an infinite sequence of integers satisfying the following two conditions:\n</p><p>(a) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/d/39dd48954afea6461cb5f99e7d4d0cfb274cdc52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m - n$\" width=\"48\" height=\"8\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/2/e3275e1f02efdb5e1f48db0d63e221bc0d897e78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q_m - q_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"59\" height=\"11\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/1/6110b48573ba2b43894b2efa9515ae954f5c0e0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m&gt;n \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>(b) There is a polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/d/d0d6860e76165db243984d3cbed120625869a612.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|q_n|&lt;P(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"89\" height=\"18\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>Prove that there is a polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/2/e422cfd3b71fe90125a91ccfd18dfbd2f9a8d4c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q_n = Q(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"79\" height=\"18\" /> for each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Step 1: Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> has degree <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> be the polynomial of degree at most <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/8/a181313f0e49a42a41927226b066a22b1ba940c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)=q_x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"81\" height=\"20\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/2/b4245e9c887f390072090288b63ec69fa59a2d32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\leq x\\leq d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />. Since the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/2/9420c77fba95e776f66162dc35551068e9690b67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q_x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"15\" height=\"11\" /> are all integers, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> has rational coefficients, and there exists <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/a/91ae6661d172e2f0a27ba5fdac76a92ab0223136.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$kQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"23\" height=\"16\" /> has integer coefficients. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/4/244c15faf2f742e20358704be37f67d7b0408cf9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m-n|kQ(m)-kQ(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"179\" height=\"18\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/d/e4d88e8b032e5fd4942c267d832b8708844d6e92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m,n\\in \\mathbb N_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Step 2: We show that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> is the desired polynomial.\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/d/e5d976d3020626d549d57e532b668d1804083fee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"45\" height=\"10\" /> be given. Now\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/3/c1340f24132e4923946e2fb39f4c5d4dd35ada33.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[kq_x\\equiv kq_m\\pmod{x-m}\\text{ for all integers }m\\in[0,d]\\]\" width=\"391\" height=\"18\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/c/c6c7fa213c6813494e0736af5cc2e37888f453a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$kQ(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"47\" height=\"18\" /> satisfies these relations as well, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/c/17cb64fa3dfebe793783f564a98611b2a4b40945.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$kq_m=kQ(m)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"108\" height=\"18\" />,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/1/3e1ff1e92902e48772febc49805fc7f15a48aad1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[kq_x\\equiv kQ(x)\\pmod{x-m}\\text{ for all integers }m\\in[0,d]\\]\" width=\"409\" height=\"18\" />\nand hence\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/d/dad7ec77a68ecee74761f256858b4ca0b719eb0c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[kq_x\\equiv kQ(x)\\pmod{\\text{lcm}(x,x-1,\\ldots, x-d)}. \\;(1)\\]\" width=\"386\" height=\"18\" />\nNow\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/a/77a05f6acd4d5f1681971382a7b3806f68646d43.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\text{lcm}(x,x-1,\\ldots, x-i-1)&amp;=\\text{lcm}[\\text{lcm}(x,x-1,\\ldots, x-i),x-i-1]\\\\ &amp;=\\frac{\\text{lcm}(x,x-1,\\ldots, x-i)(x-i-1)}{\\text{gcd}[\\text{lcm}(x,x-1,\\ldots, x-i),(x-i-1)]}\\\\ &amp;\\geq \\frac{\\text{lcm}(x,x-1,\\ldots, x-i)(x-i-1)}{\\text{gcd}[x(x-1)\\cdots(x-i),(x-i-1)]}\\\\ &amp;\\geq \\frac{\\text{lcm}(x,x-1,\\ldots, x-i)(x-i-1)}{(i+1)!} \\end{align*}\" width=\"543\" height=\"168\" />\nso by induction <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1ab3d8769ec5cfd94c508969c19b9f603886470e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{lcm}(x,x-1,\\ldots, x-d)\\geq \\frac{x(x-1)\\cdots (x-d)}{d!(d-1)!\\cdots 1!}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"359\" height=\"43\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/2/9720bc260a3da2af42f3d3c19f872759b02e9ad3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x), Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"84\" height=\"18\" /> have degree <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, for large enough <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> (say <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/a/e3a8ae68d097b16594955dc68ac7ff8684566909.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;L$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" />) we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/5/8a50036287368b4caab24d53f53ede1f73e13871.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left|Q(x)\\pm\\frac{x(x-1)\\cdots (x-d)}{kd!(d-1)!\\cdots 1!}\\right|&gt;P(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"288\" height=\"43\" />. By (1) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/1/e71bda0a1b966fb79f0296bbac527cbad5922e83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$kq_x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"25\" height=\"16\" /> must differ by a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/5/de5d63de0b7861e4084b4a1825561b27366197d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{lcm}(x,x-1,\\ldots, x-d)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"181\" height=\"18\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/c/c6c7fa213c6813494e0736af5cc2e37888f453a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$kQ(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"47\" height=\"18\" />; hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/2/9420c77fba95e776f66162dc35551068e9690b67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q_x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"15\" height=\"11\" /> must differ by a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/c/30c7f9cf9eb84fb6746da960cab5e7a3cae55b5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x(x-1)\\cdots (x-d)}{kd!(d-1)!\\cdots 1!}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"152\" height=\"43\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dfe7c7a0b887097fa2227a230fc915ba2e5477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" />, and for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/a/e3a8ae68d097b16594955dc68ac7ff8684566909.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;L$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" /> we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5bb1474fb333956b664da0d5395c9469579a77d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q_x=Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"81\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Now for any <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/d/35dd0c6534377021b2a32ec332680ca1a35e16a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$kQ(y)\\equiv kQ(x)\\equiv kq_x \\equiv kq_y\\pmod{x-y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"326\" height=\"18\" /> for any <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/a/e3a8ae68d097b16594955dc68ac7ff8684566909.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;L$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/3/643e1765342cf3807fd7d130ee679b71ecd4789b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" /> can be arbitrarily large, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/0/070dd0bc69025e3b6d6ce633e4d22323a8d1b67e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(y)=q_y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"18\" />, as needed.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:40%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_USAMO\" title=\"1995 USAMO\">1995 USAMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_USAMO_Problems\" title=\"1995 USAMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=27&amp;year=1995\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1995 USAMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1995 USAMO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1995 USAMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1995 USAMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1995 USAMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1995 USAMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USAMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"USAMO Problems and Solutions\"> All USAMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017185443\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.047 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.068 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 287/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1267/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 9273/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.395      1 -total\n 56.23%    8.094      1 Template:USAMO_box\n 40.35%    5.808      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:12041:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017185443 and revision id 94418. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}